# Dhall: The Dhall configuration language standard (dhall-lang/standard, grammar dhall.abnf); requirements/languages/dhall.md
name     dhall

keyword  if then else let in as using merge forall with toMap showConstructor assert missing
type     Bool Natural Integer Double Text List Optional Type Kind Sort Date Time TimeZone
builtin  True False None Some

ident-part     /-
line-comment   --
block-comment  {- -}  : nested
string   '' ''  : multiline interp=dollar-braces
string   " "    : escapes interp=dollar-braces
escape        : u-braces u4
operators  +*=<>&|:\?#.-
upper-type
